        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Norman Borlaug\n- Works: \"The Frankenfood Myth\"\n- Movements: Green Revolution\n- Plants: Onobrychis viciifolia, alfalfa, clover\n- Topics: agricultural modernization, forage replacement\n\nFacts:\n- Norman Borlaug, the author of the foreword in \"The Frankenfood Myth,\" was an American agronomist.\n- Norman Borlaug worked on the Green Revolution and won the Nobel Peace Prize.\n- The Green Revolution included the replacement of Onobrychis viciifolia with high-yielding alfalfa and clover species.",
